      "writtenOn": "2025-09-27T04:06:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I added some stuff similar to DAWN_SERIALIZE. Unfortunately it\u0027s still a little brittle. On the capture side you can capture a full command which is (cmd id, params), but on the replay side, there\u0027s no compile time connection between a cmd id and its params. You need to read out the cmd id first, then pick the params. I feel like we shouldn\u0027t obsess over this for now. I literally spent the entire week futsing with serialization and yet AFAICT it\u0027s all temp anyway so I\u0027m not sure how much more to spend on it. I hope it\u0027s okay for now.",
