        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 116,
      "author": {
        "id": 1003446
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-09-27T04:06:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I made `BufferWGPU` to inherit from `RecordableObject`?  That\u0027s fine for moving `CaptureCreation` to BufferWGPU::CaptrueCreation but I\u0027m not sure moving the ID makes sense. If you captured twice then the code above would fail because on the 2nd capture the objects would be marked as already captured.\n\nThat said, in order to coordinate both capture and replay the command format for Buffer (and Texture, etc) have to be shared, either by some external .proto file or, as for now dawn/replay/Seralization.h.",
      "parentUuid": "6c3d3e45_f7502706",
      "revId": "8a9a34ee85b09b562d5c9eb42e402fcae9a7fb70",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
