      "writtenOn": "2025-09-22T18:27:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m a bit surprised that the capture context is on the queue instead of the device. Won\u0027t we want to capture other things like buffer mapping, resources destroy, bindless bindgroup updates in the future, things like that?",
      "revId": "8a9a34ee85b09b562d5c9eb42e402fcae9a7fb70",
